.Dd November 8, 2026
.Dt PRON-GET 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pron-get ,
.Nm pron-cache
.Nd apt-style package manager for porn, over Tor
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm pron-get
.Cm search
.Op Fl page Ar n
.Ar words ... | listing-url
.Nm pron-get
.Cm show
.Ar package | url
.Nm pron-get
.Cm install
.Op Fl q Ar height
.Op Fl hls
.Op Fl j Ar n
.Op Fl x Ar n
.Op Fl limit Ar n
.Op Fl search Ar words
.Op Fl y
.Ar package | url | listing-url ...
.Nm pron-get
.Cm remove
.Op Fl y
.Ar package ...
.Nm pron-get
.Cm update
.Nm pron-get
.Cm upgrade
.Op Fl q Ar height
.Op Fl j Ar n
.Op Fl x Ar n
.Op Fl limit Ar n
.Op Fl y
.Nm pron-get
.Cm list
.Op Fl upgradable
.Nm pron-get
.Cm add-source
.Ar listing-url | Cm search Ar words
.Op Cm limit= Ns Ar n
.Nm pron-get
.Cm edit-sources
.Nm pron-get
.Cm torcheck
.Nm pron-get
.Cm moo
.Pp
.Nm pron-cache
.Cm search Ar regex | Cm show Ar package | Cm pkgnames | Cm stats
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a simple command line interface for downloading and installing
video packages.
It works almost like Debian's
.Xr apt-get 8 ,
except that a
.Em package
is one video, named by its viewkey, and the
.Em archive
is the website.
The most frequently used commands are
.Cm update
and
.Cm upgrade .
.Pp
Every request goes through Tor.
If no Tor SOCKS proxy is running,
.Nm
starts a private
.Xr tor 1
and stops it on exit.
Before any request reaches the site, check.torproject.org must confirm
that traffic leaves through a Tor exit; otherwise
.Nm
refuses to continue and nothing is sent.
.Pp
Installed packages live in
.Pa ~/pr0n/ Ns Ar package Ns Pa / ,
one directory per video, holding the video file and a
.Pa pkg.json
manifest with its title, source, size and SHA-256.
Interrupted downloads keep a
.Pa .part
file and resume where they stopped.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "edit-sources"
.It Cm search Ar words ...
Search the site and print one package per line: an installed mark
.Pq Sy i ,
the package name, the duration and the title.
.Fl page Ar n
shows later result pages.
.It Cm search Ar listing-url
List the videos on a model, pornstar, channel, user, playlist or category
page, following its pages up to
.Fl limit Ar n
results (default 100,
.Sy 0
for all).
.It Cm show Ar package
Print the title, uploader, duration, homepage, install status and every
available version (quality and format) of a package.
.It Cm install Ar package ...
Download packages.
Arguments may be viewkeys, video URLs, or listing URLs, which are expanded
into the newest
.Fl limit Ar n
videos of each (default 3,
.Sy 0
for all).
.Fl search Ar words
adds the results of a search.
When listings are involved, the packages to install are shown first and
.Nm
asks before downloading.
Installing a package by name clears an earlier
.Cm remove .
.It Cm remove Ar package ...
Delete packages after showing how much space is freed.
Removed packages are remembered, so
.Cm upgrade
does not bring them back.
.It Cm update
Fetch every source in
.Xr sources.list 5
and rebuild the package index.
Each source is fetched on its own Tor circuit.
A source that fails keeps its previous index entries.
.It Cm upgrade
Install every package in the index that is neither installed nor removed.
The list is shown, and confirmed, before any network traffic.
.Fl limit Ar n
installs at most
.Ar n
packages.
.It Cm list
List installed packages, newest first.
With
.Fl upgradable ,
list what
.Cm upgrade
would install instead.
.It Cm add-source Ar source
Check a source and append it to
.Pa sources.list .
.It Cm edit-sources
Open
.Pa sources.list
in
.Ev VISUAL ,
.Ev EDITOR ,
or
.Xr vi 1 ,
then check it.
.It Cm cache Ar command
The same as
.Nm pron-cache .
.It Cm torcheck
Connect to Tor and print the exit address that would be used.
.It Cm moo
Has Super Cow Powers.
.El
.Ss pron-cache
.Nm pron-cache
queries the package index offline, like
.Xr apt-cache 8 .
It is the same binary: a symbolic link named
.Nm pron-cache
runs
.Nm pron-get Cm cache .
.Bl -tag -width "pkgnames"
.It Cm search Ar regex
Print index entries whose name, title or source matches the
case-insensitive
.Ar regex .
Installed packages are marked
.Sy i ,
removed ones
.Sy r .
.It Cm show Ar package
Print what the index knows about a package.
.It Cm pkgnames
Print every package name in the index.
.It Cm stats
Print counts of indexed, installed, upgradable and removed packages,
the number of sources, and the age of the index.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
These options are accepted by every command:
.Bl -tag -width "-sources file"
.It Fl dir Ar dir
Where packages are installed.
Default:
.Pa ~/pr0n .
.It Fl tor Ar host : Ns Ar port
Use this Tor SOCKS proxy.
By default
.Nm
starts its own tor, so a system tor or Tor Browser closing mid-download
doesn't stop it.
.It Fl tor-bin Ar path
The
.Xr tor 1
binary to start when
.Fl tor
is not given.
.It Fl sources Ar file
The
.Xr sources.list 5
to use.
.It Fl index Ar file
The package index to use.
.It Fl site Ar url
The site's base URL.
Default:
.Lk https://www.pornhub.com .
.It Fl onion
Use the site's onion service instead of a Tor exit.
.El
.Pp
Options for
.Cm install
and
.Cm upgrade :
.Bl -tag -width "-sources file"
.It Fl q Ar height
Highest quality to fetch, for example
.Sy 720 .
Default: the best available.
If nothing is that small, the smallest version is used.
.It Fl hls
Prefer the HLS stream over the single MP4 file.
HLS streams are remuxed to MP4 with
.Xr ffmpeg 1
when it is installed, and saved as MPEG-TS otherwise.
.It Fl j Ar n
Run
.Ar n
downloads in parallel (at most 8).
Each job has its own Tor client and circuits.
.It Fl x Ar n
Fetch each mp4 over
.Ar n
connections (default 4, at most 8), each on its own Tor circuit with its
own signed media URL.
Tor limits speed per circuit, so this is about
.Ar n
times faster.
.Fl x Cm 1
uses a single connection.
.It Fl y
Assume yes; do not prompt.
.El
.Sh SOURCES.LIST
One source per line.
A source is a listing URL or
.Cm search
followed by words.
A trailing
.Cm limit= Ns Ar n
sets how many of the newest videos are indexed from it (default 40,
.Sy 0
for all).
.Sy #
starts a comment.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
https://www.pornhub.com/model/example-model
https://www.pornhub.com/playlist/123456789 limit=100
search oil massage limit=20
.Ed
.Sh PRIVACY
.Bl -bullet
.It
Tor or nothing: no request is made without a confirmed Tor exit, and
.Ev HTTP_PROXY ,
.Ev HTTPS_PROXY
and any system
.Pa torrc
are ignored.
.It
No DNS leaks: hostnames are resolved inside Tor.
The private tor runs with
.Sy SafeSocks 1 ,
which refuses any request that would need a local lookup.
.It
Unlinkable: every installed video, every
.Cm update
source and every parallel job uses a fresh circuit
.Pq Sy IsolateSOCKSAuth ,
so the site sees each from a different exit.
.It
Tor Browser's User-Agent; cookies live in memory and die with the process.
.El
.Pp
.Nm
does not protect what is on your disk:
.Pa ~/pr0n
is ordinary files.
The site still sees what is downloaded, just not by whom.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width XDG_CONFIG_HOME
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME
If set, sources.list is read from
.Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/pron-get/ .
.It Ev VISUAL , Ev EDITOR
Editor for
.Cm edit-sources .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It Pa ~/.config/pron-get/sources.list
Sources for
.Cm update ;
created with examples on first use.
.It Pa ~/Library/Caches/pron-get/index.json
The package index built by
.Cm update .
.It Pa ~/Library/Caches/pron-get/tor/
State of the private tor (guards and consensus), kept so later runs
start quickly.
.It Pa ~/pr0n/ Ns Ar package Ns Pa /pkg.json
Manifest of an installed package.
.It Pa ~/pr0n/.removed
Packages that
.Cm upgrade
skips.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
Usage errors exit with 1, bad options with 2, and failures with 100,
like
.Xr apt-get 8 .
Interrupting a download exits with 130 and keeps the partial file.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Find something and install it at 720p:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ pron-get search oil massage
$ pron-get install -q 720 6a0123456789a
.Ed
.Pp
Install the 10 newest videos of a model, three at a time:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ pron-get install -j 3 -limit 10 \e
      https://www.pornhub.com/model/example-model
.Ed
.Pp
Follow a playlist and keep up with it:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ pron-get add-source https://www.pornhub.com/playlist/123456789
$ pron-get update && pron-get upgrade -j 3
.Ed
.Pp
Search the index offline:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ pron-cache search 'massage|spa'
.Ed
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Tor check failed, refusing to continue
Tor could not be reached, or check.torproject.org did not see a Tor exit.
Nothing was sent to the site.
.It media URL is bound to a different exit IP
Video links are signed for one IP address, and some Tor exits send
traffic from several.
.Nm
resolves the video again on a new circuit and resumes.
.It the site demands age verification from this exit
The exit's country requires age verification.
.Nm
does not bypass it; try again later from another exit.
.It video is not available in the Tor exit's country
The video is geo-blocked where the exit is.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
