.Sh HISTORY
.Nm porn-get
was written by tarzeau on 27 June 2001
.Dq just for the fun of it
as the package manager of the joke distribution Lesbian GNU/Linux.
It was a bash script on top of
.Xr lynx 1
and
.Xr wget 1 .
pl0pix rewrote it in 2003 as version 0.5.1, the last release.
.Nm
picks up the version numbering at 0.6.0.
The surviving releases are archived in
.Pa history/
in the source tree.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An tarzeau
wrote porn-get in 2001 with
.Dq the PORN team ;
.An pl0pix
rewrote it in 2003.
.Nm pron-get
is by the pron-get contributors, 2026.
.Sh BUGS
Only public videos are supported.
Premium, private and locked videos are reported, not downloaded.
.Pp
The site's onion service was offline in November 2026, so
.Fl onion
may not work.
.Pp
One Tor circuit carries about 0.5 to 1.5 MB/s; see
.Fl x
and
.Fl j .
.Pp
This manpage has been started.
